Heat the @ground semolina{50%g} and @milk{450%g} in a #small saucepan{}, stirring continuously, until boiling.

Reduce the heat and simmer for ~{10%minutes} (or until the required consistency is reached), stirring occasionally.

Stir in the @caster sugar{25%g}.